	quest.34044A1FEAE1FBF8.quest_desc: [
		"&9Crafting CPU&r manages a single auto crafting task from start to finish, built of various crafting units."
		"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
		"To be a valid &9Crafting CPU&r, two rules must be met:"
		"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
		"&o1)&r The &bCPU&r must be a cuboid, completely composed of the parts listed above; air or other blocks are not valid."
		"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
		"&o2)&r The &bCPU&r must contain at least 1 &nstorage component&r."
		"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
		"The &9Crafting CPU&r as a multi-block only requires a single &eChannel&r for the entire structure. &7Crafting co-processors&r increase the number of tasks the &9Crafting CPU&r can perform at once; with no co-processors, the &9Crafting CPU&r can perform a single task at a time."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"You can name your &9Crafting CPUs&r by naming any of the crafting units it is made up of with an &aInscriber&r or an &0Anvil&r."
		"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
		"To provide patterns to the autocrafting cpus you can use &dME Interface&r or &eME Level Emitter&r."
		"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
		"&2Crafting Unit&r provides the &bCPU&r with no additional features, but can be used as a \"&nfiller&r\" block. It is the base for crafting the other functional components of a crafting &bCPU&r."
	]
