	quest.7E7E1F881343D567.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &a&lUNALTERED+&r!"
		""
		"&7I created this modpack because I wanted a &f&lVANILLA+ &r&7experience that feels familiar, simple, and comfortable to play. My goal is not to change Minecraft, but to gently improve it with quality-of-life features and subtle refinements."
		""
		"&7Some of the mods here are still things I’m learning and adjusting over time, but I’m always doing my best to make your experience smoother, more balanced, and more enjoyable."
		""
		"&7Thank you for playing, and I hope you have a great journey in this world. If you have any suggestions, ideas, or just want to share your experience, feel free to leave a comment on the modpack’s CurseForge page. I always read everything with care, and it helps me a lot to improve Unaltered+"
	]
